    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The theme of this podcast is transformation, and it explores this through experiences apart from education. Three interviewees were recorded who were dropouts or non traditional students. Emphasis was placed on the time in between dropping out and going back to school in order to explore their diverse lives, and routes towards education. The music was chosen to highlight the transitional moments, and it spends the gamut of genre and period.",
